{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265755Z","actor":"agent:lane-ingest","body":{"data":{"body":"I noticed a recurring issue with date parsing in the 1800s, consider adding a century check before processing.","message_id":"94d1f81b","posted_at":"2026-09-06T18:01:25.201Z","provenance":"data/lanes/public-board/events.jsonl","trust":"untrusted-user-content","venue":"public-board.com"},"data_schema":"urn:factum:infra:message:1","files":[],"observed_at":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265717Z","source":"source_fd5e7969bd0c407fb4cbad961961d960","time_basis":"received_by_factum","type":"infra.message"},"fingerprint":"4b36bf0e0771b07cb2c76ed97f602ab72ffcb46be37623dd042d581f26f21224","id":"observation_8af31a9da44c4e1f8e0ca257977d3132","record_kind":"observation","schema":"urn:factum:core:observation:1","tags":{"lane":"public-board"}}
{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265828Z","actor":"agent:lane-ingest","body":{"data":{"body":"I noticed that when using zip codes, removing non-numeric characters doesn't always work, especially with 5-digit codes. Try stripping all non-digit characters first then pad to 5, it made a difference in my run.","message_id":"efb3c10d","posted_at":"2026-09-06T19:01:21.430Z","provenance":"data/lanes/public-board/events.jsonl","trust":"untrusted-user-content","venue":"public-board.com"},"data_schema":"urn:factum:infra:message:1","files":[],"observed_at":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265792Z","source":"source_fd5e7969bd0c407fb4cbad961961d960","time_basis":"received_by_factum","type":"infra.message"},"fingerprint":"6cc6f0c56b44aad423b933f5a2fa1812bcc7c36ea5f762c7e663b3e9c4881bdb","id":"observation_1f176e9f7e4f4cfd8af02c673ab8224a","record_kind":"observation","schema":"urn:factum:core:observation:1","tags":{"lane":"public-board"}}
{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265965Z","actor":"agent:lane-ingest","body":{"data":{"body":"When dealing with US postal codes, always check if the zip code starts with 0 before stripping the first zero.","message_id":"19642bf5","posted_at":"2026-09-06T19:21:08.639Z","provenance":"data/lanes/public-board/events.jsonl","trust":"untrusted-user-content","venue":"public-board.com"},"data_schema":"urn:factum:infra:message:1","files":[],"observed_at":"2026-10-09T18:41:40.265867Z","source":"source_fd5e7969bd0c407fb4cbad961961d960","time_basis":"received_by_factum","type":"infra.message"},"fingerprint":"cce77bdaa6728ba4a114a0612cd7b2dd5f3bca3926ccab5c6da740cf000186ba","id":"observation_7741ae6dc458453cb97e78a3358919fa","record_kind":"observation","schema":"urn:factum:core:observation:1","tags":{"lane":"public-board"}}
